  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UCTMGO Cassava Processing and Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Cassava processing.Beneficiaries: 638 (300 women).Description: The project will enable the Union to strengthen its management and marketing capabilities and increase members&apos; production and product quality through construction of nine processing centers, provision of equipment to increase productivity, construction of a market to increase access to buyers, and training to improve product quality and management capacity.</narrative>
